    Q("Which equation links a rate constant to temperature?", ["The Arrhenius equation", "The Nernst equation", "The Henderson–Hasselbalch equation", "The Bragg equation"], "k = A·e^(−Ea/RT): a higher temperature gives more molecules enough energy to cross the barrier."),
